<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_29__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Authority may charge fees in respect of any services provided by the Authority under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
