<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Every document required or permitted to be lodged or filed with the Authority under this Act shall be lodged or filed through a trust company."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
