<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Every application to the Authority for any certificate or for any extract or copy of any certificate to be issued under this Act or of any document lodged or filed with the Authority shall be made through a trust company."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_34__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection (2) shall not apply where an application is made in respect of an offshore limited partnership by any of the partners of that offshore limited partnership and the document, certificate, extract or copy is for his own personal use."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
