<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_38__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_38__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding any provision in this Act, where the Authority is satisfied that an offshore limited partnership—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
