<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_38__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "In the event the Authority—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_38__subsec_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_38__subsec_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
