<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The rules of equity and of common law applicable to partnerships shall continue in force, except so far as they are inconsistent with the express provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
