<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_III__cl_44__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The provisions of the Partnership Act 1961 shall not be applicable to an offshore limited partnership established or registered under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
