<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (3), no judgment shall be enforced against any property of an offshore limited partnership unless such judgment has been granted against a general partner in his capacity as a general partner of that offshore limited partnership."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_10> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
