<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_10__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in subsection (1) shall preclude the enforcement of an order of the court relating to the property of an offshore limited partnership in any case where, by reason of any of the events mentioned in paragraph 22(l)(a) or 22(1)(b), a judgment could not be granted against a general partner in his capacity as a general partner of that offshore limited partnership."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
