<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "during business hours, to inspect and make copies of or take extracts from the offshore limited partnership books, documents and records; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
