<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "to be given, on demand, true and full information of all things affecting the offshore limited partnership and to be given a formal account of partnership affairs whenever circumstances render it just and reasonable."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
