<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_11__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A limited partner shall not be entitled to dissolve the offshore limited partnership by notice except as provided under subsection 22(3)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
