<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Except where the limited partner is also a general partner, a limited partner having, with respect to anything done under subsection (1), a claim against the assets of the offshore limited partnership shall rank as a creditor of the offshore limited partnership in respect of such claim."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
