<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this section, a claim described in subsection (2) does not include a claim for a return of capital contributions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
