<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_17__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection (5) shall not be construed to imply that the possession or exercise of any other power by a limited partner will necessarily constitute the participation by such limited partner in the management of the offshore limited partnership."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
