<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_21__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "In the event of the dissolution of an offshore limited partnership its affairs shall be wound up by the general partners unless the activities of the offshore limited partnership are taken over and continued in accordance with subsection 22(2) or unless the court otherwise directs under subsection 23(2)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_21__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_21> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
