<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_21__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If the affairs of the offshore limited partnership are not wound up by the general partners after its dissolution, each of the general partners shall be guilty of an offence and shall on conviction be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
