<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_22__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An offshore limited partnership shall not be required to be wound up under subsection (1) if, within 60 days of the dissolution, the limited partners, either unanimously or as otherwise provided for in the partnership agreement, elect one or more general partners, in which event the offshore limited partnership shall be deemed not to have been dissolved and the activities of the offshore limited partnership may be taken over and continued as provided for in the partnership agreement or a subsequent partnership agreement,"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_22__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_22> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_22__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
