<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Except as provided in this Act, legal proceedings by or against an offshore limited partnership shall be instituted by or against any one or more of the general partners only and no limited partner shall be a party to or named in such proceedings."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
