<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A general partner or, with the leave of the court, any other person shall have the right to join or otherwise institute proceedings against one or more of the limited partners who may be liable to the offshore limited partnership pursuant to subsection 12(3), subsection 15(2), section 16 or subsection 17(3)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_25__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_25> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
