<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any property of an offshore limited partnership which is transferred to or vested in or held on behalf of any one or more of the general partners or which is transferred to or vested in the name of the offshore limited partnership shall be held or deemed to be held by the general partner, or, if more than one, by the general partners jointly, as an asset of the offshore limited partnership in accordance with the terms of the partnership agreement."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_II__cl_9__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any debt or obligation incurred by a general partner in the conduct of the activities of an offshore limited partnership shall be a debt or obligation of the offshore limited partnership."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
