<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_I__cl_1> <https://schema.org/name> "This Act may be cited as the Labuan Offshore Limited"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@/~part_I__cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Partnerships Act 1997 and shall come into force on such date as the Minister may, by notification in the Gazette, appoint."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/9/eng@> .
